# Witness for ColdLoadMeetsCoreStraddler. The check is reduced to the entry's provenance, so the
# invariant fails exactly when a straddler is admitted through a cold-loaded entry.
MODULE: ColdLoadMeetsCoreStraddlerWitness
TARGET: ColdLoadMeetsCoreStraddler
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a straddler admitted through a cold-loaded entry is reachable: the edge's check is not vacuous

--- FIND
Fails("ColdLoadMeetsCoreStraddler", ~cold["S"] \/ CStraddlerAlloc)
--- REPLACE
Fails("ColdLoadMeetsCoreStraddler", ~cold["S"])
--- END
